  "prefLabel": "Gen 304.01 Eligibility Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 304.01 Eligibility Requirements. Eligibility requirements for full initial licensure shall be:\n\n(a) An academic degree which is at least a master’s degree;\n\n(b) A currently valid certificate issued by the ABGC or ABMG; and\n\n(c) Good professional character and reliability as evidenced by:\n\n(1) The answers to the questions from the application form specified in Plc 304.03; and\n\n(2) The criminal offender record report(s) required by RSA 328-F:18-a.\n\nSource. #10686, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13555, eff 4-11-23; ss by #14337, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen300.html"
